## 🚀 5. INSTALLATION & SETUP GUIDE

### Prerequisites
* Python version `3.10` or higher installed on your local machine.
* All required project source files: `app.py`, `interface.py`, `lgb_model.pkl`, and `requirements.txt`.

### Virtual Environment Setup and Installation
Open your Terminal at the root directory of the project (`Project_5`) and execute the following commands in sequence:

```bash
# 1. Initialize an independent virtual environment to avoid library conflicts
python -m venv .venv

# 2. Activate the virtual environment (Windows)
.venv\Scripts\activate

# 3. Install production-grade library packages
pip install -r requirements.txt